# MovieLens + TMDB + Wikidata: the sources ExportSources lifts to the meta level.
#
# Each line names a source in the store its publisher already ships it for, so the model
# assignment here records where the data came from rather than a choice we made.

# MovieLens publishes these four as relational CSVs.
postgres     pg     movielens  movies
postgres     pg     movielens  links
postgres     pg     movielens  tags
postgres     pg     movielens  ratings

# TMDB publishes its daily identifier export as newline-delimited JSON.
mongo        mongo  tmdb       movies

# The Wikidata slice is an entity graph keyed by Q-identifier. Its two MovieLens identifier
# fields are lists, which the exporter lifts to scopes of their own; there are no edges, so no
# neo4j-rels line belongs here.
neo4j-label  graph  neo4j      WikidataFilm
